  "description": "The WebDAV core of Elarion's CalDAV and CardDAV support (ADR-0111), without a wire: a hardened XML reader and a forward XML writer, the DavDispatcher for OPTIONS, PROPFIND, REPORT and GET over principals, homes, published collections and their objects, RFC 6578 sync-collection with durable sync tokens, the IDavCollectionStore seam of the published-collection store and its change journal, and the IDavProtocol seam CalDAV and CardDAV plug into. No ASP.NET Core, no EF Core, no reflection.",
